  m_text: "OBJECTIVE\n\nStop enemies from reaching the center.\n\nClick a hex to
    send a wave through the grid.\nMoving hexes damage enemies standing on them.\n\nEnemies
    that reach the center damage your Base.\nIf Base HP reaches 0, you lose.\n\nCONTROLS\n\nLeft
    Click \u2014 Attack a Hex\nMiddle Mouse Drag \u2014 Move Camera\nMouse Wheel
    \u2014 Zoom\nI \u2014 Toggle Guide"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
